# TLS-terminating reverse proxy for AGT Knowledge Base (SEC-4, DEP-10).
# Caddy obtains and renews the certificate for the host name automatically.
#
# The Docker Compose stack publishes its web port on 127.0.0.1:8080 (APP_PORT).
# In config.yaml, set server.trustProxy: 2 (this proxy plus the bundled Nginx)
# and keep session.secureCookie: auto. See README, HTTPS.

kb.example.org {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
